  "definition": "Length of Funding",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-07-12",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4000) #13815, INTERIM, eff 12-1-23, EXPIRES: 5-29-24; ss by #14024, eff 7-12-24",
